 * \brief     Main application
 * \file      main.c
 * \author    Hugo Arends 
 * \date      April 2026
 *
 *            Modified version of the serial2lpuart forwarder. It still
 *            forwards data between LPUART0 and LPUART2, but it also detects
 *            the HAN AEA H0.37 iBeacon and blinks the RGB LED blue when that
 *            beacon is seen. Pressing the board button switches the LED to
 *            solid green.
 *
 *             MCU-Link                FRDM-MCXA153                  Device
 *            +--------+    +----------------------------------+    +--------
 *            |      RX|<---|LPUART0_TX/P0_3 < LPUART2_RX/P1_4 |<---| TXD
 *        <-->|USB   TX|--->|LPUART0_RX/P0_2 > LPUART2_TX/P1_5 |--->| RXD
 *            |        |    |                              3V3 |----| VCC
 *            |        |    |                              GND |----| GND
 *            +--------+    +----------------------------------+    +--------
 *
 * \see       NXP. (2024). MCX A153, A152, A143, A142 Reference Manual. Rev. 4,
 *            01/2024. From:
 *            https://www.nxp.com/docs/en/reference-manual/MCXAP64M96FS3RM.pdf
 *
